# {{ site.name }}

> Independent, plain-language information about ME/CFS (myalgic encephalomyelitis / chronic fatigue syndrome) for patients, carers and families. It covers what the illness is, symptoms, causes, pacing, POTS, sleep, tests to ask a GP for, supplements and medications (with evidence labels), clinical trials recruiting in Australia and worldwide (with study contacts), conferences, and a directory of Australian doctors. Written by {{ site.author }}. Content last reviewed {{ site.lastReviewed }}. Australian English; Australia-focused care information, international research.

Key facts about this site:
- Every treatment claim is labelled with its evidence type: RCT, controlled, open-label, observational, lab (in-vitro), adjacent field (e.g. Long COVID), or hypothesis.
- Clinical trial details and contacts were checked against official registries (ANZCTR, ClinicalTrials.gov, ISRCTN, EU CTR) on {{ site.lastReviewed }}.
- This is information only, not medical advice. The site has no advertising and no commercial affiliations.
- The full text of every page is available as a single plain-text file: {{ site.url }}/llms-full.txt

